<footer class="footer">
  <div class="foot-inner">
    <div class="foot-values serif">
      privacy of families &middot; power of quiet design &middot; preservation of memories
    </div>
    <div class="foot-bottom">
      <span>&copy; zerothreeone 2026 &middot; made for family, in California.</span>
      <span class="foot-medical">aegi is not a medical device. For clinical questions please speak with your care provider.</span>
